  "description": "Cloudflare R2 usage from the GraphQL Analytics API via cloudflare-exporter. Storage is the current object payload size. The exporter samples R2 operations per UTC day, so 'today' is the current day and monthly figures are rolling 30-day sums of the daily peaks; 'projected' extrapolates the 7-day average daily rate to a full month. Monthly free tiers: 1M Class A, 10M Class B.",
